# api-core conventions

## Layout

```
apps/api-core/src/
  main.ts, app.module.ts
  platform/     # config, prisma, redis, kafka, health, otel (owner: VV)
  common/       # filters, guards, interceptors, pipes (owner: VV)
  modules/<bc>/ # one Nest module per bounded context (see ownership)
```

## Patterns

- Cross-module I/O via `@smart/contracts` + Kafka — not deep imports of another BC's internals.
- Zod at HTTP boundary; Prisma for persistence; Redis keys always have explicit TTL.
- Structured pino logs with `traceId`; Prometheus metric on new hot paths.
- Swagger on every new endpoint; module `README.md` updated; runbook if it can page.
- Read config from `platform/config/env.ts` only — never scatter `process.env`.
- LLM calls only through `modules/ai-gateway` (Ramansh). No direct Anthropic/Gemini SDKs elsewhere.

## Schema changes

Non-VV engineers: file an issue for Vishal V (table, field, type, ticket). Do not run `prisma migrate dev` yourself.
